WEBVTT

00:04.190 --> 00:05.580
Nao-chan.

00:06.420 --> 00:09.440
Can you give me some tips 
on what to wear tomorrow?

00:11.400 --> 00:13.280
Are you going out?

00:13.280 --> 00:15.540
Yeah, to the zoo.

00:15.540 --> 00:18.830
It's going to be a scorcher. 
Better be prepared.

00:18.830 --> 00:23.620
Sorry. I know I shouldn't 
bother a pro for free advice.

00:23.620 --> 00:26.450
Oh, please. You were worried about that?

00:24.170 --> 00:26.170
<b>Stylist</b>

00:26.450 --> 00:29.800
I see. It <i>is</i> your first time 
asking me yourself...

00:30.940 --> 00:33.550
Huh? Wait, is this a date?

00:33.550 --> 00:36.760
No, no! Shima-kun's just a friend!

00:36.760 --> 00:38.580
Shima? As in, Shimasuke?!

00:38.580 --> 00:39.510
"Shimasuke"?

00:39.510 --> 00:42.810
It's Shima-kun, the friend 
I talk about all the time.

00:42.810 --> 00:46.040
<i>Didn't she say he was a popular city boy?</i>

00:46.040 --> 00:48.230
<i>Why would one of those go out with my Mitsu?</i>

00:48.230 --> 00:50.810
<i>Might be fun to fool around 
with a country girl.</i>

00:50.810 --> 00:52.330
<i>I'll dump her once I get bored.</i>

00:53.010 --> 00:54.200
Nao-chan.

00:54.200 --> 00:56.610
What do you think of this?

00:57.710 --> 01:00.080
<i>Maybe I should let her go like that.</i>

01:01.270 --> 01:04.650
<i>So dazzling</i>

01:04.650 --> 01:08.090
<i>I find myself looking away</i>

01:08.810 --> 01:11.710
<i>Unable to find the right words</i>

01:11.710 --> 01:14.500
<i>Even a single word to say</i>

01:28.840 --> 01:31.570
<i>In such a narrow world</i>

01:31.570 --> 01:35.350
<i>Your vibrant laughter</i>

01:35.350 --> 01:38.320
<i>Resonates so beautifully</i>

01:38.320 --> 01:41.130
<i>And that's what saved me</i>

01:41.570 --> 01:45.230
<i>If we relive this moment</i>

01:45.230 --> 01:48.450
<i>In an unimaginable future</i>

01:48.450 --> 01:51.420
<i>Even if we're lost, it's okay</i>

01:51.420 --> 01:55.260
<i>We will be in it together</i>

01:55.950 --> 01:59.250
<i>So dazzling</i>

01:59.250 --> 02:03.050
<i>I find myself looking away</i>

02:03.420 --> 02:06.340
<i>Unable to find the right words</i>

02:06.340 --> 02:09.170
<i>Even a single word to say</i>

02:09.170 --> 02:12.500
<i>I was entranced</i>

02:12.500 --> 02:16.610
<i>By your lively figure</i>

02:16.610 --> 02:19.760
<i>If the true nature of this blue warmth</i>

02:19.760 --> 02:22.540
<i>Is love, then…</i>

02:23.270 --> 02:26.400
<i>If the true nature of this blue warmth</i>

02:26.400 --> 02:29.180
<i>Is love, then...</i>

02:31.710 --> 02:35.370
Do you know which class Shima Sousuke's in?

02:36.010 --> 02:37.370
See you tomorrow.

02:38.120 --> 02:39.940
Sorry, you two.

02:39.940 --> 02:42.760
Ririka's a friend of mine, 
and we kinda grew up together.

02:42.760 --> 02:45.290
But she's a model and stuff,

02:45.290 --> 02:47.980
so could you keep it a secret 
that she was here?

02:47.980 --> 02:51.520
Oh... Okay, got it.

02:52.350 --> 02:55.760
Like hell you grew up together 
and she's just a friend!

02:52.980 --> 02:54.980
<b>The Youngest HT
Cover Girl in History!
Saijou Ririka</b>

02:58.110 --> 02:59.280
<b>Saijou Ririka
Model


When did Saijou Ririka
debut? Learn about her
past and the scandal!</b>

02:58.110 --> 03:02.990
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

02:58.540 --> 03:00.750
<i>Saijou Ririka...</i>

02:59.280 --> 03:02.990
<b>When did Saijou Ririka
debut? Learn about her
past and the scandal!

Embroiled in controversy

Did she really drink
when underage?

Want to learn about
Saijou Ririka's
surprising past?</b>

03:00.750 --> 03:03.010
<i>Huh, so she got her start in child acting.</i>

03:03.400 --> 03:05.670
<i>Suspected of drinking alcohol in sixth grade?</i>

03:05.670 --> 03:07.640
<i>Snapped back at haters and got canceled?!</i>

03:07.640 --> 03:09.870
<i>Eww, talk about trashy.</i>

03:10.540 --> 03:15.290
<i>But this explains why Shima-kun's 
so chill around girls.</i>

03:15.290 --> 03:19.880
<i>Outside of school, he's friends 
with these glamorous people.</i>

03:21.080 --> 03:23.640
<i>He's hanging with a girl 
every boy would die for.</i>

03:24.280 --> 03:27.170
<i>So he's just another clout chaser.</i>

03:27.170 --> 03:29.590
<i>Man, that's such a letdown.</i>

03:31.640 --> 03:35.650
<b>Finals Prep</b>

03:31.640 --> 03:35.650
<b>Exam Results</b>

03:31.640 --> 03:35.650
<b>Revision</b>

03:31.640 --> 03:35.650
<b>Status Report</b>

03:31.640 --> 03:35.650
<b>Closing
Ceremony</b>

03:31.640 --> 03:35.650
<b>Summer
Cram School</b>

03:31.640 --> 03:35.650
<b>Club</b>

03:31.640 --> 03:35.650
<b>Club</b>

03:32.600 --> 03:34.980
<i>How about Thursday or Friday 
the week after next?</i>

03:35.350 --> 03:36.770
<i>Oh, Thursday, then...</i>

03:43.980 --> 03:45.400
Mitsumi-chan!

03:46.660 --> 03:47.860
Morning.

03:48.410 --> 03:50.420
Good morning, Shima-kun.

03:50.420 --> 03:52.650
Oh, you're wearing Fumi-chan's pin.

03:53.880 --> 03:54.790
I brought her with me.

03:55.150 --> 03:57.010
I'm wearing something panda-themed, too.

03:57.010 --> 03:58.830
Really? What?

03:59.460 --> 04:01.400
Panda sleeves.

04:02.050 --> 04:04.550
<b>Chuffed</b>

04:05.580 --> 04:06.990
Anyway, let's get going.

04:06.990 --> 04:07.890
Yep.

04:14.630 --> 04:15.930
<i>They're actually here.</i>

04:16.480 --> 04:19.710
<i>God, what am I doing?</i>

04:19.710 --> 04:21.860
Are you Mitsumi's friend?

04:22.370 --> 04:24.050
I-I-It's not what you're thinking!

04:24.050 --> 04:26.050
I just happened to be 
in the area for an exhibit!

04:26.050 --> 04:29.780
Then I remembered they were 
talking about meeting in Ueno today,

04:29.780 --> 04:31.600
and would you believe it, there they were!

04:31.600 --> 04:33.960
Hold up! He's hot!

04:33.960 --> 04:35.370
Scary hot!

04:35.370 --> 04:38.180
And who might you be?

04:38.570 --> 04:42.630
<i>Wait, what has Mitsu told 
her friends about me?</i>

04:43.230 --> 04:47.140
Hello, I'm Mitsumi's uncle. 
You can check my ID if you want.

04:47.140 --> 04:48.670
Oh, hello.

04:48.670 --> 04:50.260
<i>Didn't know she had an uncle </i>and<i> an aunt.</i>

04:59.830 --> 05:02.180
Wow. I saw an actual panda, in the flesh.

05:02.180 --> 05:05.030
Sure did. It was going to town 
on that bamboo, huh?

05:05.030 --> 05:07.460
I feel like I just met a celebrity!

05:07.460 --> 05:09.560
I'm surprised we got so much 
time to observe.

05:09.560 --> 05:10.690
Yeah!

05:10.690 --> 05:12.430
Where do you wanna go next?

05:12.430 --> 05:13.950
Well...

05:13.950 --> 05:16.460
We can check out the condors, and then...

05:21.210 --> 05:25.550
<b>Hot!</b>

05:21.530 --> 05:24.160
Why don't wander around a bit 
and then cool off in the food court?

05:24.160 --> 05:25.550
Good idea.

05:46.450 --> 05:47.820
Cute!

05:47.820 --> 05:49.580
Time to dig in!

05:49.580 --> 05:51.280
Whoa, that's a big bite.

05:55.080 --> 05:57.460
This is going distressingly well.

05:57.460 --> 05:59.730
He's such a natural at taking the lead.

05:59.730 --> 06:05.380
Is Shimasuke pretty popular—
no, <i>the</i> popular guy at school?

06:01.600 --> 06:02.950
<i>"Shimasuke"...</i>

06:05.380 --> 06:07.640
Yeah, that's about right.

06:07.640 --> 06:08.970
<i>What even is this situation?</i>

06:08.970 --> 06:13.720
Be honest with me. Why do you 
think he came here with her?

06:13.720 --> 06:15.240
Beats me.

06:15.240 --> 06:18.740
It's hard to tell what he's thinking.

06:19.100 --> 06:20.810
<i>What?</i>

06:20.810 --> 06:23.970
Could he be playing with my Mitsu's heart?

06:23.970 --> 06:24.860
He wouldn't do that.

06:25.810 --> 06:26.980
Ever.

06:31.300 --> 06:33.450
So you like Shima-kun, huh?

06:33.450 --> 06:33.990
Li...?!

06:34.620 --> 06:37.300
...ke? I wouldn't go that far!

06:39.540 --> 06:44.430
It's just my goal to get myself a hot-stuff 
boyfriend while in high school!

06:44.430 --> 06:45.920
<i>This poor girl.</i>

06:47.420 --> 06:49.430
<b>Monorail East Sta.</b>

06:56.120 --> 06:57.830
This is way too risky!

06:57.830 --> 06:58.630
Shh.

07:00.220 --> 07:00.980
Oh.

07:00.980 --> 07:02.520
We're off and running.

07:05.840 --> 07:07.740
This feels nice, doesn't it?

07:07.740 --> 07:08.960
Yeah...

07:10.150 --> 07:13.910
<i>What do I do? That break 
didn't cool me off at all.</i>

07:15.050 --> 07:17.470
<i>I keep spacing out...</i>

07:18.110 --> 07:21.140
<i>I guess the nerves aren't helping.</i>

07:26.170 --> 07:27.640
Mitsumi-chan.

07:28.420 --> 07:31.760
Once we get off, let's hit up 
the gift shop and call it a day, yeah?

07:32.670 --> 07:33.740
But...

07:34.630 --> 07:36.760
I was the one who invited you...

07:37.640 --> 07:41.680
<i>And I was so excited about today...</i>

07:43.660 --> 07:45.320
We can just come again.

07:53.910 --> 07:54.930
Yeah.

08:05.420 --> 08:06.840
I'm such an idiot.

08:08.040 --> 08:10.590
<i>So he's just another clout chaser.</i>

08:12.710 --> 08:15.090
<i>I knew that wasn't true all along.</i>

08:15.570 --> 08:18.310
<i>The one who wanted a boy 
every girl would die for...</i>

08:18.990 --> 08:21.640
<i>The real clout chaser...</i>

08:22.100 --> 08:23.220
<i>was me.</i>

08:24.100 --> 08:29.860
<b>Monorail West Sta.</b>

08:26.820 --> 08:31.610
You're right. Everyone at the zoo 
in this heat is an idiot.

08:32.990 --> 08:37.180
I've been eyeing this place nearby 
that does mango shaved ice and douhua.

08:37.180 --> 08:38.540
Want to join me?

08:38.540 --> 08:40.490
Big sister's treat.

08:40.490 --> 08:41.230
Y...

08:41.230 --> 08:43.660
After all that walking, 
the calories won't even count!

08:44.190 --> 08:46.820
You're not her uncle... but her aunt?

08:46.820 --> 08:48.420
Big sister!

08:48.780 --> 08:50.800
This pouch is so cute!

08:50.800 --> 08:52.490
Plus, it's got candies inside.

08:52.490 --> 08:54.100
I'll get this for Maharu.

08:54.100 --> 08:56.650
Kippei likes snakes, so I'll get him...

08:56.650 --> 08:57.970
Not holding back, huh?

08:57.970 --> 09:02.060
My aunt gave me some extra money for gifts.

09:02.060 --> 09:03.630
Your family's pretty close, huh?

09:03.630 --> 09:04.500
Yep!

09:04.500 --> 09:06.100
Do you have any siblings?

09:06.100 --> 09:07.860
Uh...

09:07.860 --> 09:09.740
Yeah, a little brother.

09:09.740 --> 09:11.030
How old?

09:11.460 --> 09:12.430
He's three.

09:12.430 --> 09:14.700
Aww, a baby!

09:15.050 --> 09:17.560
Aren't you getting anything for him?

09:17.560 --> 09:18.930
Hmm...

09:18.930 --> 09:21.240
I dunno what he likes.

09:21.240 --> 09:23.390
I bet he'll jump for joy anyway.

09:33.400 --> 09:35.420
Thank you!

09:36.030 --> 09:37.930
And this is from me.

09:37.930 --> 09:40.200
What? Sorry. I didn't get you anything.

09:40.200 --> 09:44.430
It's fine! They just had a great deal 
on a two-pack, so don't worry about it!

09:44.960 --> 09:45.770
Look!

09:47.930 --> 09:50.400
<i>Aren't these meant for couples?</i>

09:50.750 --> 09:51.930
Shall we head out?

09:51.930 --> 09:52.830
Yeah.

09:54.710 --> 09:56.400
Maybe I'll use it as a keychain.

09:56.400 --> 09:58.080
Sounds good.

10:03.270 --> 10:05.660
Kei-chan, clean up your toys.

10:05.660 --> 10:06.870
'Kay!

10:18.450 --> 10:21.020
On second thought, do you want this?

10:22.170 --> 10:24.560
I'm pretty sure my little brother's 
been here already.

10:27.770 --> 10:29.560
Why does that matter?

10:29.870 --> 10:32.660
He'd be happy just because 
it's coming from you.

10:34.320 --> 10:36.360
Oh, you think?

10:36.720 --> 10:38.360
Isn't that obvious?!

10:46.910 --> 10:48.120
Yeah, you're right.

10:49.310 --> 10:52.680
Next time, let's come when it's cooler.

10:52.680 --> 10:54.780
Yeah, agreed.

10:55.960 --> 10:57.460
<b>Sweet Tooth Cafe
Douhua</b>

10:57.460 --> 10:59.470
Yum, so good!

10:59.470 --> 11:01.340
I forgot to take a picture!

11:01.340 --> 11:04.450
Oh, no! I wanted to post this on Pinsta, too!

11:04.450 --> 11:05.550
Pinsta...

11:06.010 --> 11:06.940
Oh?

11:07.970 --> 11:11.980
<u>Scene 08: Heat and Complications</u>

11:11.980 --> 11:13.980


11:14.980 --> 11:16.900
Thanks for having us!

11:15.880 --> 11:17.230
Thanks for having us...

11:17.230 --> 11:19.240
Welcome!

11:19.990 --> 11:21.740
<i>We're having a girls' pajama party!</i>

11:22.240 --> 11:25.110
<i>Sorry, some relatives are 
crashing at my place...</i>

11:25.110 --> 11:25.950
<i>Oh no...</i>

11:25.950 --> 11:27.330
<i>Don't worry. Stuff happens.</i>

11:27.330 --> 11:30.460
<i>Yuzu-chan's place became 
unavailable at the last minute...</i>

11:30.460 --> 11:33.570
We only have one extra futon for guests,

11:33.570 --> 11:35.950
but you kids are young, so squeeze in!

11:35.950 --> 11:37.330
Thank you!

11:37.330 --> 11:41.030
<i>...but Nao-chan gave us 
permission to do it here instead.</i>

11:41.030 --> 11:45.430
Don't forget to tell them that 
your aunt is biologically male.

11:45.430 --> 11:47.290
It'd really hurt me 
if that caused them to panic.

11:47.290 --> 11:48.220
Got it.

11:49.730 --> 11:52.890
Thank you all for being friends with Mitsumi!

11:52.890 --> 11:55.110
Oh, thank you, Nao-san.

11:55.110 --> 11:56.400
Don't mention it.

11:56.400 --> 11:58.400
It must've been so hot outside.

11:58.400 --> 12:02.180
Oh, no need to sit on the floor, dear. 
Here, use this cushion.

12:02.180 --> 12:03.660
Thank you very much.

12:03.660 --> 12:06.810
Mitsu, there's pudding in the fridge.

12:06.810 --> 12:08.280
Bring it out for everyone later.

12:08.280 --> 12:09.240
Will do.

12:09.720 --> 12:11.460
Okay, have fun!

12:15.960 --> 12:19.440
Your aunt is so nice, Mitsumi!

12:19.440 --> 12:21.020
She smelled great, too.

12:21.020 --> 12:21.620
Yeah.

12:21.620 --> 12:23.050
I know, right?

12:23.050 --> 12:25.060
Nao-chan's a stylist.

12:25.060 --> 12:26.720
No way! That's so cool!

12:26.720 --> 12:28.770
Her mouth looks just like yours.

12:28.770 --> 12:30.590
<i>They're so sweet!</i>

12:30.590 --> 12:32.230
<i>I'm so happy for you, Mitsu.</i>

12:32.710 --> 12:35.120
This translation doesn't make sense to me!

12:35.120 --> 12:39.230
It's a special case, because it's an adverb.

12:39.230 --> 12:40.330
It's a -ly, right?

12:40.330 --> 12:41.700
A "ly"?

12:41.700 --> 12:43.110
Yeah, a -ly.

12:45.010 --> 12:46.930
We've made decent progress, huh?

12:46.930 --> 12:48.030
Want to take a break?

12:48.030 --> 12:49.280
I am <i>done</i> done.

12:49.670 --> 12:52.690
Mika, your blouse is really cute. 
Where'd you get it?

12:52.690 --> 12:55.270
Thanks. It's just a basic ZU.

12:55.270 --> 12:57.710
I didn't know they had stuff like that.

12:58.100 --> 13:00.970
I wish I could wear lace.

13:00.970 --> 13:03.410
You could wear anything, Yuzuki!

13:03.410 --> 13:06.460
I've been told it doesn't fit my image.

13:06.460 --> 13:07.670
Oh...

13:08.200 --> 13:09.720
I saw something on Pinsta.

13:09.720 --> 13:12.570
How about this? The color isn't too girly.

13:12.570 --> 13:15.460
Oh, that could be cute! I'll give it 
a like so I can check it later.

13:15.460 --> 13:18.590
I'd love to wear chino pants like those, too.

13:15.650 --> 13:17.330
<i>Fashion talk...</i>

13:17.890 --> 13:19.480
<i>I want to keep up!</i>

13:18.590 --> 13:20.360
Huh? You totally should!

13:20.360 --> 13:23.490
Nah, beige really doesn't suit me.

13:24.610 --> 13:28.570
Oh, so you're a blue base, Mika-chan?

13:28.570 --> 13:30.580
Don't just randomly drop 
fashion buzzwords on me!

13:30.580 --> 13:32.560
You knew about that stuff, Mitsumi?

13:32.560 --> 13:34.580
Nao-chan taught me.

13:34.580 --> 13:38.080
<b>Fashion Buzzwords that
even Mitsumi (kinda) knows</b>

13:34.580 --> 13:38.090
Fashion buzzwords that 
even Mitsumi kinda knows!

13:34.580 --> 13:52.060
<b>Blue Base
(Cool skin tone)</b>

13:34.580 --> 13:52.060
<b>Yellow Base
(Warm skin tone)</b>

13:38.090 --> 13:39.470
Blue base, or a cool skin tone,

13:39.470 --> 13:42.980
is blue-tinged skin that looks good 
wearing pink, purple, and similar colors.

13:42.980 --> 13:44.690
Yellow base, or a warm skin tone,

13:44.690 --> 13:48.300
is golden-tinged skin that looks good 
wearing orange, beige, and similar colors.

13:48.300 --> 13:52.180
This concept can help you find 
the right makeup or clothes for you!

13:52.580 --> 13:55.010
By the way, I'm a yellow base.

13:55.010 --> 13:56.350
Stop that!

13:57.190 --> 13:59.190
<b>Blueberries?</b>

13:57.450 --> 13:58.480
Blueberries?

13:58.480 --> 14:00.030
That's so funny.

14:00.030 --> 14:01.310
You're cute!

14:02.250 --> 14:06.190
I'm so glad I decided to take 
the high school entrance exams.

14:06.190 --> 14:09.110
You went to a combined 
middle and high school, right?

14:09.110 --> 14:12.050
Oh, so you had to decide between 
staying or applying elsewhere?

14:12.050 --> 14:13.370
Yep.

14:13.370 --> 14:16.640
Honestly, I wasn't having a good time 
with friends in middle school.

14:16.640 --> 14:20.780
I kept getting dragged 
into relationship drama.

14:22.130 --> 14:26.630
By the time I realized I wasn't vibing with 
them, the groups were already formed.

14:27.420 --> 14:32.640
I was trying so hard to fit in, I forgot 
what I disliked about the situation.

14:32.640 --> 14:36.820
I realized I never should 
have put up with it.

14:36.820 --> 14:41.120
So I decided to start over 
and wear my heart on my sleeve.

14:41.570 --> 14:46.980
I was so set on not letting anyone mess 
with me that I came off as unapproachable.

14:46.980 --> 14:49.860
Like, I seemed pretty nasty at first, no?

14:47.990 --> 14:50.280
<b>Prickly</b>

14:50.280 --> 14:51.880
So you had a high school rebranding.

14:51.880 --> 14:53.480
I didn't go that far!

14:53.480 --> 14:55.080
All I did was pierce my ears!

14:55.080 --> 14:58.030
Once school started, 
I realized I was trying too hard.

14:58.030 --> 15:00.830
I was like, "Oh, this is fine?"

15:01.320 --> 15:06.770
I've always wanted friends 
I could speak from the heart with.

15:06.770 --> 15:08.090
So I'm happy I met you guys.

15:09.030 --> 15:11.050
I know what you mean... kind of.

15:11.050 --> 15:12.840
Really? You too, Mika?

15:12.840 --> 15:16.030
You didn't really have to 
<i>say</i> all that, y'know?

15:16.030 --> 15:17.850
You're making me blush.

15:18.390 --> 15:19.430
Want a rice cracker?

15:19.430 --> 15:20.740
Gimme.

15:20.740 --> 15:25.200
<i>But Yuzuki's friendly and beautiful.</i>

15:25.200 --> 15:27.200
<i>Plus, she's smart.</i>

15:27.200 --> 15:28.980
<i>And given she lived abroad,</i>

15:28.980 --> 15:31.680
<i>her family must have a business 
or manufacturing background.</i>

15:31.680 --> 15:34.620
<i>She probably went to an international 
school or something.</i>

15:35.640 --> 15:42.000
<i>The kids in her school were likely 
smart enough to see how special she was.</i>

15:42.000 --> 15:47.750
<i>And I can see why some of them would 
want to pick on her "just a little bit."</i>

15:48.130 --> 15:53.530
<i>Is that a sign that I'm one of them, too?</i>

15:56.500 --> 15:57.930
Mukai.

15:57.930 --> 16:00.180
Huh? You joined summer cram school, too?

16:00.180 --> 16:03.060
Yeah. Not like I have 
anything better to do at home.

16:04.040 --> 16:07.070
<i>Yeah, I guess his family situation 
is kinda complicated.</i>

16:08.230 --> 16:09.270
Hey...

16:09.270 --> 16:12.120
You came here for high school 
entrance exams too, right?

16:12.120 --> 16:12.760
Yep.

16:12.760 --> 16:16.230
I knew it! You got into Tsubame West, right?

16:16.230 --> 16:18.540
Someone from our middle school got in, too!

16:18.540 --> 16:20.450
Wow, really?

16:20.450 --> 16:23.290
<i>Pisses me off, though...</i>

16:23.290 --> 16:25.420
These peanut-chocolate rice crackers are good, no?

16:25.420 --> 16:28.070
Really? I'd rather eat 
each of those separately.

16:28.070 --> 16:31.820
It's an all-rounder that 
combines sweet and salty.

16:34.030 --> 16:35.890
I'll be heading out now.

16:35.890 --> 16:37.010
Oh, okay.

16:37.010 --> 16:40.270
I'm staying the night at 
a friend's place after the exhibition.

16:40.270 --> 16:42.640
Make yourselves curry for dinner.

16:42.640 --> 16:45.470
Oh, but turn off the stove 
and lock the doors before bed!

16:45.470 --> 16:47.650
Okay. Thanks, Nao-chan.

16:48.110 --> 16:49.080
Oh.

16:49.080 --> 16:50.900
Are you good on time, Mika-chan?

16:50.900 --> 16:53.890
Huh? Oh... Yeah.

16:53.890 --> 16:55.820
I should head out now.

16:55.820 --> 16:57.310
Oh, you're leaving?

16:57.310 --> 16:59.530
Her family's going out for dinner tonight.

16:59.530 --> 17:01.380
Oh... I forgot about that.

17:01.380 --> 17:03.130
Time flies.

17:03.130 --> 17:04.190
See you.

17:04.540 --> 17:06.070
Bye!

17:06.070 --> 17:07.560
Yeah, bye.

17:15.080 --> 17:16.400
Let me guess.

17:16.400 --> 17:18.360
There's no dinner tonight, is there?

17:19.050 --> 17:20.010
Thought as much.

17:20.790 --> 17:24.220
I mean, I know we'll end up 
talking about relationships later.

17:24.220 --> 17:25.450
It'd be awkward.

17:25.450 --> 17:29.310
<i>So, she doesn't want to hear 
Mitsu talking about Shimasuke.</i>

17:29.310 --> 17:31.940
<i>She is so in love.</i>

17:31.940 --> 17:35.820
It's just my goal to get myself a hot-stuff 
boyfriend while in high school!

17:35.820 --> 17:38.920
<i>Why does she have to deny it like that?</i>

17:40.660 --> 17:42.580
<i>A blouse released this year...</i>

17:42.580 --> 17:45.930
<i>An outfit that screams 
she keeps up with fashion.</i>

17:46.350 --> 17:49.750
<i>And if she got into Tsubame West, 
she must be a hard worker.</i>

17:50.500 --> 17:54.350
<i>Yet she lacks confidence 
and fears getting hurt.</i>

17:58.770 --> 18:00.420
<i>That sounds awfully familiar.</i>

18:05.270 --> 18:06.450
Listen, Mika.

18:06.450 --> 18:07.690
<i>"Mika"?!</i>

18:07.690 --> 18:11.460
If there's even a tiny part of you 
that wants to stay,

18:11.460 --> 18:15.690
call Mitsu right now and tell her you got 
the date for your family dinner wrong.

18:15.690 --> 18:18.850
N-No! It's too late, and it's too cringe.

18:18.850 --> 18:21.240
And what's wrong with that?

18:21.240 --> 18:24.370
Having a little bit of a cringe side 
will make you more endearing.

18:24.760 --> 18:27.370
I don't know why you're 
such a scared little mouse,

18:27.750 --> 18:32.270
but the chance to make real friends 
doesn't come around too often in life.

18:35.810 --> 18:37.060
Wanna get something to eat?

18:37.060 --> 18:39.770
Oh, sure. Let me call home.

18:39.770 --> 18:40.630
Okay.

18:43.950 --> 18:45.750
Hello? Hey, Mom?

18:46.430 --> 18:49.030
My friend's asking if I can eat out with him.

18:47.730 --> 18:49.440
<b>Roger</b>

18:47.730 --> 18:49.440
<b>Let Chris know, too</b>

18:47.730 --> 18:49.440
<b>Gotcha</b>

18:47.730 --> 18:49.440
<b>Shibuya. The usual place.</b>

18:49.440 --> 18:52.020
Yeah, so if dinner's not ready yet...

18:49.440 --> 18:52.020
Sorry, Mukai. I can't after all.

18:52.550 --> 18:53.110
Huh?

18:53.110 --> 18:54.280
Hey!

18:55.580 --> 18:57.840
Actually, Mom, I'll eat at home.

18:57.840 --> 18:59.600
I'll eat like hell.

19:05.080 --> 19:06.620
Heya.

19:06.620 --> 19:07.850
Where're the others?

19:07.850 --> 19:08.910
Didn't invite them.

19:08.910 --> 19:11.370
Hey, we agreed not to meet up alone.

19:11.370 --> 19:14.500
Drop it. Let's go.

19:21.740 --> 19:23.260
Where are we going?

19:23.260 --> 19:26.200
Nowhere specific. Just taking a stroll.

19:28.900 --> 19:31.520
Ririka, you've been acting weird lately.

19:37.890 --> 19:39.890
What'd you do today? Work?

19:39.890 --> 19:42.800
Yeah. My summer break's packed with shoots.

19:42.800 --> 19:44.280
I start at 5 AM tomorrow, too.

19:44.280 --> 19:47.430
Yikes. We should just go home, then.

19:47.430 --> 19:50.220
I've become an early riser myself.

19:50.660 --> 19:53.200
Because you've been going 
to school like a good boy?

19:53.200 --> 19:54.000
Yeah, I guess.

19:57.880 --> 19:59.310
That reminds me!

20:00.440 --> 20:04.260
That bob-haired girl I saw in the 
classroom is your favorite, isn't she?

20:04.660 --> 20:07.930
"Favorite"? She's a friend of mine.

20:09.390 --> 20:11.220
I knew it!

20:11.220 --> 20:14.020
You've always taken a liking 
to the circus acts.

20:15.580 --> 20:18.150
Don't talk about my friend like that.

20:22.430 --> 20:24.360
You're the one acting weird.

20:25.010 --> 20:28.370
You think it's okay now that four years 
have passed since the controversy?

20:28.990 --> 20:31.420
Because I've made a comeback as a model?

20:31.750 --> 20:33.230
Well, it's not okay.

20:34.260 --> 20:37.590
My life will always be under a microscope.

20:37.590 --> 20:39.320
Everything I do will be used against me.

20:39.750 --> 20:42.780
All because I went with you that night.

20:46.550 --> 20:49.970
So don't think you have any right to have 
a fun little high school life of your own.

20:56.350 --> 20:57.480
Sorry.

20:59.650 --> 21:01.860
I'm going home. Walk me.

21:06.360 --> 21:08.490
Hold my hand.

21:08.490 --> 21:09.080
Huh?

21:09.080 --> 21:10.660
Not like that!

21:13.040 --> 21:15.040
Like you did when we were kids.

21:27.260 --> 21:29.200
Should we flavor the meat first?

21:29.200 --> 21:30.260
Don't ask me.

21:30.260 --> 21:31.470
Wow!

21:31.470 --> 21:32.520
That looks great!

21:32.520 --> 21:34.200
Yum! So yummy!

21:34.200 --> 21:35.780
Yeah, it's actually good.

21:34.520 --> 21:35.780
Yeah.

21:35.780 --> 21:36.310
No way!

21:36.310 --> 21:38.440
Okay, breathe out.

21:36.980 --> 21:38.440
Around the size of a 500 yen coin.

21:38.440 --> 21:39.180
Ow, ow.

21:39.180 --> 21:41.070
How big's a 500 yen coin, again?

21:41.070 --> 21:43.320
Empty your mind and apply.

21:49.900 --> 21:51.550
Eek!

22:27.410 --> 22:31.670
<i>A gentle breeze, the setting sun</i>

22:31.670 --> 22:35.990
<i>Today was another good day</i>

22:35.990 --> 22:40.330
<i>Forgetting all the plans I made</i>

22:40.330 --> 22:44.340
<i>I'll walk to the next station over</i>

22:44.340 --> 22:49.010
<i>The more I trip and fall</i>

22:49.010 --> 22:53.020
<i>The better I get at picking myself back up</i>

22:53.020 --> 22:57.590
<i>Through honest dialogue and heart-to-hearts</i>

22:57.590 --> 23:01.990
<i>The warmth seeps into my soul</i>

23:01.990 --> 23:06.280
<i>Humming as I take the roundabout way</i>

23:06.280 --> 23:10.410
<i>My world is an unsolved mystery</i>

23:10.410 --> 23:14.920
<i>Top speed, toes and heels, strides</i>

23:14.920 --> 23:19.080
<i>Each one of us walks differently</i>

23:19.080 --> 23:23.600
<i>All the same, we wave goodbye to dusk</i>

23:23.600 --> 23:27.590
<i>As a new morning dawns</i>

23:27.590 --> 23:32.260
<i>Wanting to protect this everyday life</i>

23:32.260 --> 23:35.480
<i>With a hop, jump, and skip</i>

23:35.480 --> 23:38.730
<i>See you tomorrow</i>
